Rule 9 (Dimension must be an integer between -10000 and 10000)
{v_1 : int} |= -10000 ≤ v_1 ∧ v_1 ≤ 10000
>>
Rule 10 (input tensor and output tensor must have the same dtype)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2)
>>
Rule 11 (If dimension is none, tensor should be one dimensional)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 then false
